  "question": {
    "text": "If two parabolas <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> have only one common point <math><mi>P,</mi></math> then the coordinates of <math><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;are"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
